        "title_tag": "h2",
        "title_font_style": "h3",
        "description": "<p>Darshan with Paramahamsa Vishwananda is a rare, direct, personal blessing from an enlightened Master. In this sacred moment, the veil is lifted, and one can perceive the Divine Love and Grace which is already present within and around us.<br\/><br\/>Just one moment can have a profound impact mentally, physically, emotionally, and spiritually.<br\/><br\/>People come away from encounters with Paramahamsa Vishwananda feeling a profound, heart-opening awakening of unconditional love and acceptance such as they have never felt before. Many receive healing from specific ailments, peace and calm of mind, and a feeling of being connected to the core essence of oneself — the soul.<br\/><em><br\/>Register today for this rare opportunity. Limited spaces available. <\/em><\/p>",
        "credits": ""
      }
    },
