    "section_icon_grid_QfR3bE": {
      "type": "section__icon-grid",
      "blocks": {
        "content_block_88fU6F": {
          "type": "content_block",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Enjoy_Sacred_Music_e0aa809c-e3df-43fc-9c19-0fcdde1375b6.png",
            "title": "Enjoy Sacred Music",
            "title_tag": "h3",
            "title_font_style": "h5",
            "description": "<p>One of the highlights of any Darshan Blessing is the amazing kirtan and bhajan! Kirtan is the call and response singing of the Divine Names, and is a powerful and fun way to open the heart and feel the presence of the Divine within and around us.<\/p>"
          }
        },
        "content_block_bRpdR3": {
          "type": "content_block",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Positive_Atmosphere_1.png",
            "title": "Positive Atmosphere",
            "title_tag": "h3",
            "title_font_style": "h5",
            "description": "<p>Step into a world of positivity & connected with a likeminded community of spiritual seekers from around the globe! Darshan is deeply nourishing for the mind, body, and soul. Find healing, peace, and the joy of celebrating life.<\/p>"
          }
        },
        "content_block_g4G4Lh": {
          "type": "content_block",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/A_Precious_Blessing_77b673c0-c4b0-44fa-91a6-83a4727b7bd9.png",
            "title": "A Precious Blessing",
            "title_tag": "h3",
            "title_font_style": "h5",
            "description": "<p>The blessing of a living Satguru is beyond rare. Unique for everyone, it has been described as a showering of unconditional love; a moment with the Divine; a glimpse into your own inner beauty; a deep peace; and a catalyst for spiritual transformation.<\/p>"
          }
        },
        "content_block_FzqmmK": {
          "type": "content_block",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/icon-placeholder.png",
            "title": "Experience deep connection",
            "title_tag": "h3",
            "title_font_style": "h5",
            "description": "<p>There is nothing as powerful as profound, deep connection rooted in Love. Transform your relationship with your Self, others, and the Divine in ways you never before imagined possible.<\/p>"
          }
        },
        "content_block_q7wQy8": {
          "type": "content_block",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/icon-placeholder.png",
            "title": "Build on a lasting foundation",
            "title_tag": "h3",
            "title_font_style": "h5",
            "description": "<p>Gain the tools you need to build a strong, sustainable foundation to build a life of Love and meaning. These practices and spiritual knowledge will give you the confidence to end the rat race<\/p>"
          }
        },
        "content_block_arD8jE": {
          "type": "content_block",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/icon-placeholder.png",
            "title": "Discover a Love that can’t be taken",
            "title_tag": "h3",
            "title_font_style": "h5",
            "description": "<p>Have you looked for love in all the wrong places, only to feel let down again and again? Discover a love which can’t be broken, can’t be taken from you, and never ends. The Love of your soul.<\/p>"
          }
        }
      },
