    "section_event_calendar_fF9RNM": {
      "type": "section__event-calendar",
      "blocks": {
        "calendar_item_zrtK3J": {
          "type": "Calendar_item",
          "settings": {
            "date_title": "Arrival",
            "title": "Upliftment",
            "content": "<p>When you arrive for Darshan with Paramahamsa Vishwananda, you'll check in with our welcoming team before stepping into the serene beauty of the temple. As you take in the sacred atmosphere, you’ll be immersed in the uplifting energy of live kirtan, filling the space with devotion and joy. Whether you choose to join in the singing, sit in quiet reflection, or connect with fellow seekers over snacks at the café, every moment prepares your heart for the divine blessing of Darshan.<\/p>",
            "image": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/9_Forms_Bhakti.jpg"
          }
        },
        "calendar_item_wCjn8G": {
          "type": "Calendar_item",
          "settings": {
            "date_title": "Spiritual Talk & Kirtan",
            "title": "Inspiration",
            "content": "<p>When Paramahamsa Vishwananda arrives, He starts by sharing an inspiring satsang, offering profound spiritual wisdom that uplifts and goes straight to the heart. Soon, the atmosphere ignites with joy as He leads everyone in the most ecstatic kirtan, filling the temple with divine love and energy. With hearts open and spirits lifted, the sacred moment of Darshan begins.<\/p>",
            "image": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Soul_Awake.jpg"
          }
        },
        "calendar_item_ArQz9V": {
          "type": "Calendar_item",
          "settings": {
            "date_title": "Blessings",
            "title": "Pure Love",
            "content": "<p>As Darshan begins, Paramahamsa Vishwananda offers his first blessing collectively to everyone present. He invites everyone to close their eyes, go deep within their hearts, and offer a personal prayer or intention. <\/p><p>After, you are invited by sections to line up for your personal Blessing. During this time, the temple is alive with beautiful devotional music and sacred Vedic chanting. You are welcome to join in the singing, dance in celebration, or simply sit and soak in the divine atmosphere as you await your turn for the one-on-one blessing.<\/p>",
            "image": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/2024-08-25-p-0882.jpg"
          }
        },
        "calendar_item_cfHkfC": {
          "type": "Calendar_item",
          "settings": {
            "date_title": "Enjoy",
            "title": "Celebrate",
            "content": "<p>After receiving your blessing, you’re welcome to stay and enjoy the sacred atmosphere, sit in meditation, or leave whenever you feel ready. Downstairs, our café and shop offer a space to connect with like-minded people, enjoy a snack, or explore spiritual books and items. Whether through quiet reflection or uplifting conversations, the experience of Darshan continues to unfold. As you head home, the grace and positivity of the event stays with you long after the event. <\/p>",
            "image": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/2024-08-13-p-0721.jpg"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "calendar_item_zrtK3J",
        "calendar_item_wCjn8G",
        "calendar_item_ArQz9V",
        "calendar_item_cfHkfC"
      ],
