        "content_block_iVedkM": {
          "type": "content_block",
          "settings": {
            "title": "The Temple",
            "title_tag": "h3",
            "title_font_style": "h3",
            "description": "<p>There are few places in this world that are soley dedicated to prayer for humanity. At the Paranitya Narasimha Temple and Ashram, the monks pray day and night, creating an incredibly high vibrational atmosphere of Love and positivity for all to soak in.<\/p><p>On the path of Bhakti – prayer takes the form of ecstatic singing, joyful dancing, delicious blessed food, and spiritual inspiration to align you with your highest purpose and authentic self.<\/p><p>Register today to experience it for yourself at Darshan with Paramahamsa Vishwananda!<br\/><br\/>Paranitya Narasimha Temple<br\/>1100 W. Church St. Elmira, NY<\/p>",
            "credits": "",
