    "section_accordion_eVtHNJ": {
      "type": "section__accordion",
      "blocks": {
        "accordion_item_emUQpJ": {
          "type": "accordion_item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Who is Darshan for? Do I need to be religious\/hindu to attend Darshan?",
            "content": "<p>Darshan is for everyone! You don’t need to be Hindu or even consider yourself spiritual—just come with an open heart. <\/p><p>Paramahamsa Vishwananda’s Darshan is a gift of unconditional love, meant for anyone seeking a deeper connection, peace, or simply a beautiful experience. <\/p><p>No prior experience or belief system is required—just be yourself and enjoy the uplifting energy of the event.<\/p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_item_rPjfcM": {
          "type": "accordion_item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What should I wear to Darshan?",
            "content": "<p>Darshan is a joyful and festive occasion, and all are welcome to come as you are. <br\/><br\/>As a general guideline, we encourage you to wear modest attire that reflects the sacredness of the experience. <\/p><p>If you are wearing a tank top, we ask to please bring a shawl to cover your shoulders while receiving Darshan. <\/p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_item_7TFdiQ": {
          "type": "accordion_item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is the temple handicap\/ wheelchair assessable?",
            "content": "<p><strong>Yes!<\/strong> Our temple is wheelchair accessible through a separate entrance. However, please note that we do not have an elevator to access the lower level. If you need any assistance during your visit, our team will be happy to help ensure you have a comfortable and enriching experience. Let us know how we can support you! <\/p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_item_mQ3rJ9": {
          "type": "accordion_item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can I bring items to get blessed by Guruji?",
            "content": "<p>Yes! Feel free to bring books, photos, murtis (deities), or malas. We will also have items available at our shop as well. Simply hand them to an attendant before receiving darshan.<\/p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_item_7CKjgY": {
          "type": "accordion_item",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "title": "How can I get shaktipat if I am online only?",
            "content": "<p><strong>What is the refund policy?<\/strong><\/p><p>Request a refund at least <strong>14 days before<\/strong> the program start date to receive a <strong>100% refund<\/strong> of your payment.<br\/><br\/>If you request a refund between <strong>7-13 days before<\/strong> the start date, you will receive a <strong>50% refund<\/strong>.<br\/><br\/>Refund requests made <strong>less than 7 days before<\/strong> the program start date are not eligible, as program resources and preparations will already be in place.<\/p><p><strong>How to Request a Refund:<\/strong><\/p><p>To request a refund, please contact our support team at info@bhaktimarga.us with your enrollment details. Refunds will be processed to the original payment method within <strong>7-10 business days<\/strong>.<\/p><p><strong>Exceptions:<\/strong><\/p><p>Refunds will not be issued for missed sessions, schedule conflicts, or personal circumstances. However, in cases of <strong>extraordinary situations<\/strong>, please reach out to discuss possible options.<\/p><p>We appreciate your understanding and look forward to supporting you on your spiritual journey with <strong>Bhakti Marga!<\/strong><\/p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_item_Bpxjbg": {
          "type": "accordion_item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Will it be live-streamed?",
            "content": "<p>Absolutely! The beginning of the event will be <em>live-streamed on YouTube<\/em>, including the powerful group blessing with Guruji! <\/p><p>You’ll have the incredible opportunity to receive Darshan from the comfort of your own home and feel the divine energy as it flows through the entire gathering.<\/p><p>It’s a beautiful way to connect with Guruji and experience the energy, no matter where you are.<\/p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_item_a6Qb7Q": {
          "type": "accordion_item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How do I get to Elmira, New York?",
            "content": "<p>Getting to <strong>Elmira, NY<\/strong> is easy with several nearby airports offering travel options. Here's how you can plan your trip:<\/p><p><strong>Direct Flights<\/strong><br\/><br\/>The <strong>Elmira Corning Regional Airport (ELM)<\/strong> is the closest airport to the ashram, just a 15-minute drive away. While direct flights to Elmira may be limited and sometimes more expensive, you can fly to one of the following airports with direct flights to Elmira:<\/p><p>Detroit (DTW)<br\/>Orlando (SFB)<br\/>Punta Gorda (PGD)<br\/>Tampa (PIE) <\/p><p><strong>Nearest Airports<\/strong><br\/><br\/>Elmira Corning Regional (ELM) – 15 minute drive <\/p><p>Ithaca Tompkins International(ITH) – 45 minute drive <\/p><p>Syracuse Hancock International (SYR) – 1 hr 45 min. drive <\/p><p>Greater Rochester International (ROC) – 2 hour drive <\/p><p>Newark Liberty International (EWR) – 3.5 hour drive<br\/><strong><br\/>Coming from NYC<br\/><br\/><\/strong>Drive: 4.5 (depending on traffic) <\/p><p>Bus: There are affordable buses from NYC using OurBus. ($50, 5.5 hours)  <a href=\"https:\/\/www.ourbus.com\/\">https:\/\/www.ourbus.com<\/a><\/p><p>Flight from Ithaca: You can find a direct flight from NYC to the Ithaca Tompkins airport <br\/><br\/>Safe travels, and we look forward to welcoming you! 🙏✨<\/p>"
          }
        }
      },
